  {
    "id": "anno-nakatsu_lower_p193_left-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "官員　不詳"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "官員　不詳"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Officials (the establishment headcount): recorded as 不詳, \"not detailed / unknown.\" Nakatsu returned no figure for how many posts it filled. This is why the three rank labels further left print bare — on leaves where a domain did report the number, each label carries its own 一人／二人／四人 beneath it. The office-holders are still named, fifteen of them."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "中津藩官員"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p193_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2433,989,92,507"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-nakatsu_lower_p193_left-02",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "兵隊　士千五十九人　卒八百七十八人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "兵隊　士千五十九人　卒八百七十八人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: 1,059 men of the shizoku (former samurai) class and 878 of the sotsu (lower retainer) class; 1,059 + 878 = 1,937 in all. The heading 兵隊 is centred over two runs printed side by side, the shizoku figure on the right and the sotsu figure on the left. The second glyph of the shizoku figure is 千, its slanted stroke sitting on the horizontal, and the fourth is a plain-cross 十 — both checked at 8x, since confusing the two is a hundredfold error. The project dataset gives the shizoku figure as 二千五百七十九人 (2,579) and the total as 3,457; that reading needs nine glyphs and the printed run holds exactly six, with the column blank from y1151 down to y1341 above 士, so the page does not support it."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "中津藩兵隊"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p193_left.jpg",
